    "derived_from_dataset_structure_only": true,
    "evidence": "The image families cover an identical association set to the text ones (387/387), share zero templates with them, and are emitted by the sealed hierarchy_metrics as retain_*_entity_image blocks that the frozen floor never read. All three facts are properties of queries.parquet and of the sealed metric, and both are checkable in the basis report without loading a prediction.",
    "direction_is_against_interest": "Stratifying adds four conditions to the floor and makes it harder to pass. Measured on the eight Stage-1 candidates, the image route loses more retention than the text route for 7 of 8, so the extension enlarges the failure it reports rather than shrinking it.",
    "what_would_have_been_unacceptable": "Choosing between stratifying, pooling and dropping the image route after seeing which of the three produced the preferred verdict. All three were computed; the stratified one is frozen because pooling would average two instruments that do not measure the same thing, and the pooled numbers are reported beside the decision so that choice is visible."
  }
